{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model combining scvi_n200 RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder, using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6315 is slightly lower than the RNA-only scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501), with F1 also lower (0.6068 vs 0.6275). The result suggests that adding image data may not improve performance, but the exact contribution of the image encoder or fusion method remains uncertain due to lack of comparative isolation."
}

